      "georeferenceRemarks": "[Locality is not georeferenced because, after spending a significant amount of time trying to decipher the meaning of all the mileages and directions given, along with the handwriting on the original field notes, exact tributary could not be interpreted. Some things to note: there is a creek (Little Limestone Creek) in Washington County that flows NE-SW and passes under US 11E and is E of Greene Hill (not Greenville) and ca. 7 miles WSW (not SW) of Johnson City; found Leesburg and Chuckey (but both are in TN, not VA and the creek is not .1 mile W of Leesburg or 12.6 miles N of Chuckey.]",
